  "subject": "a cha chaan teng cook who for twenty years has slipped a two-word note under each order slip he passes to his wife at the cashier counter",
  "caption": "Cantonese neo-psychedelic soft pop, Tame Impala-like. Slowly phased clean electric guitar arpeggios, round melodic bass, warm Rhodes electric piano chords, soft dry drums with a tape-delayed snare, light shaker. Hazy analog tape warmth, swirling chorus and phaser, wide but gentle. Male light tenor, intimate, clearly sung melody with doubled harmony on the hook. 96 BPM, D major. Warm, tender and hazy. No trap hi-hats, no autotune, no rap, no EDM drop, no big ballad strings.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n廚房窗口好熱\n我叫一聲 收銀呀\n你喺櫃面抬起頭\n笑我又整濕張單\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n張單底下有張紙仔\n寫住兩隻字畀你\n\n[Chorus]\n兩隻字 我寫咗廿年\n你收咗錢 先偷偷睇\n成間舖頭冇人知\n得我同你知\n\n[Verse]\n落雨嗰日我寫 帶遮\n落班我喺門口等你\n你生日我寫 對唔住\n因為又唔記得買花\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n你個鐵罐裝晒啲紙仔\n廿年都裝唔滿\n\n[Chorus]\n兩隻字 我寫咗廿年\n你收咗錢 先偷偷睇\n熟客問你笑乜嘢\n你話冇嘢\n\n[Verse]\n今朝你喺張單後面\n第一次寫字返畀我\n字好細又好歪\n寫住 多謝\n\n[Bridge]\n成個廚房都靜咗\n我燶咗兩隻蛋\n\n[Chorus]\n兩隻字 我寫咗廿年\n你寫兩隻字 我記一世\n成間舖頭冇人知\n得我同你知\n\n[Outro]\n收銀呀 收銀呀\n仲有一張單",
